sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STW as Data Protection Steward
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as ErasureRequestsController
    participant S as ErasureRequestService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STW->>W: Open pending erasure requests
    W->>C: GET /api/ErasureRequests/search?status=pending
    STW->>W: Execute one request
    W->>C: PUT /api/ErasureRequests/{id}/execute
    C->>S: ExecuteAsync(StewardId, ErasureRequestId)
    S->>R: Load request with key and consent
    alt not pending, or the attribute was shared again
        S-->>C: ConflictException
        C-->>W: 409 Conflict
    else
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate AttributeKey (wrappedKey = null, status = destroyed, destroyedAt)
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate every STUDENTDATA value under the key (dataValue = null, erasedAt) and CORRECTIONREQUESTS values
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate request (status = completed, executedBy, executedAt)
        S->>R: SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: UPDATE ATTRIBUTEKEYS, STUDENTDATA, CORRECTIONREQUESTS, ERASUREREQUESTS (one transaction)
        S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, "Your withdrawn data was erased")
        S-->>C: true
        C-->>W: 200 OK
    end
